This makes the examiner's job easy - they can see at a glance that the article meets standards.
10.⁠ ⁠Field-Specific Benchmarks
Recent data analysis of 4,560 EB-1A cases shows that Academic/Research and Business/Management professionals have the highest approval rates at around 16%, while the overall approval rate is only 11.95% Medium. For AI/data science:

